Spec: SpecDD Reference Text Updater

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Replace SpecDD reference text during IntelliJ refactors without relying on element manipulators.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDReferenceTextUpdater.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDReferenceTextUpdater.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDPathReference.kt
  ./SpecDDSymbolReference.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDReferenceTextUpdaterBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Update reference text through the containing file document.
  Compute replacement offsets from the source element file range and the reference range inside that element.
  Commit the document after replacement.
  Return the original source element after replacement.
  Fall back to returning the original source element when no containing file or document exists.
  Avoid `@ElementManipulators` because SpecDD PSI files do not provide a text manipulator.

Must not:
  Parse or validate SpecDD syntax.
  Resolve references.
